; Preserve-profile behavioral fixture for the wasm record-owned open-map mutation door.  The
; hand-written wasm tests decode non-minimal entry encodings, mutate the parent, and assert the
; old entries replay byte-exactly while the new entry is appended with default encodings.
open = { required: uint, * tstr => uint }
pair = {
  required: uint,
  * tstr => uint ; @duplicates preserve
}
